  "ID": "52474",
  "post_title": "Primera embolada cerril del año en Veo",
  "post_date": "2015-01-11 11:49:17",
  "post_name": "primera-embolada-cerril-del-ano-en-veo",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>Mucha gente la noche de este s&aacute;bado en la plaza de Veo y alrededores en el primer toro cerril del a&ntilde;o en la comarca Espad&aacute;n-Mijares, de la ganader&iacute;a San Miguel, adquirido en la finca &#39;El Brau&#39;, de nombre &#39;Le&oacute;n&#39;, guarismo 8, n&uacute;mero 3. Ha sido complementado con otro ejemplar de la ganader&iacute;a Hermanos Zorrilla.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/01/IMG_0194.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Las fiestas se retoman el jueves, con misa a mediod&iacute;a y procesi&oacute;n en honor a Sant Marcel. El viernes ser&aacute; la misa y procesi&oacute;n por Sant Antoni, tambi&eacute;n a partir de las 20 horas, para encender, a continuaci&oacute;n, la hoguera, repartir rollos bendecidos, bizcocho y moscatel, con baile de disfraces a medianoche, amenizado por el grupo flamenco De calle.</p>\n<p>El s&aacute;bado tambi&eacute;n habr&aacute; misa a mediod&iacute;a y procesi&oacute;na las 20 horas, en honor al Sant&iacute;simo Cristo de la Sed. A medianoche, baile con el d&uacute;a Adrenalina. El domingo 18, a las 14 horas, gran comida final de fiestas.</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatveo15/img_0105.jpg\" alt=\"img_0105\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatveo15/img_0107.jpg\" alt=\"img_0107\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatveo15/img_0108.jpg\" alt=\"img_0108\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatveo15/img_0109.jpg\" alt=\"img_0109\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatveo15/img_0110.jpg\" alt=\"img_0110\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatveo15/img_0111.jpg\" alt=\"img_0111\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatveo15/img_0116.jpg\" alt=\"img_0116\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatveo15/img_0117.jpg\" alt=\"img_0117\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatveo15/img_0118.jpg\" alt=\"img_0118\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatveo15/img_0121.jpg\" alt=\"img_0121\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatveo15/img_0124.jpg\" alt=\"img_0124\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatveo15/img_0125.jpg\" alt=\"img_0125\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatveo15/img_0126.jpg\" alt=\"img_0126\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatveo15/img_0128.jpg\" alt=\"img_0128\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatveo15/img_0129.jpg\" alt=\"img_0129\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatveo15/img_0131.jpg\" alt=\"img_0131\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatveo15/img_0132.jpg\" alt=\"img_0132\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouembolatveo15/img_0134.jpg\" alt=\"img_0134\" style=\"max-width:100%;height: